{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "schinese", "appid": 548430, "month": "2018-10", "window": 3, "start_date": 1539648000, "end_date": 1540339199, "month_true_total": 31, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:51:38 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "45361154", "author": {"steamid": "76561198446237035", "personaname": "公鸡开大巴", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198446237035/", "num_games_owned": 162, "num_reviews": 20, "playtime_forever": 12333, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2833, "last_played": 1779475615, "avatar": "3189a438213ca54663b859a8a9187c1a6b3e82bc"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "hao", "timestamp_created": 1540056331, "timestamp_updated": 1699824359, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.495000004768371582", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "45350964", "author": {"steamid": "76561198030860780", "personaname": "Delusion Joker", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198030860780/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 25, "playtime_forever": 76374, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7434, "last_played": 1763538901, "avatar": "7e8b40413524f5c8c37a8b1a468d2e55c61b928c"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "游戏性很强，更新后更耐玩了\n制作组更新很频繁，甚好", "timestamp_created": 1540017101, "timestamp_updated": 1540017101, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "45336802", "author": {"steamid": "76561198300723505", "personaname": "昭昭云端月丶", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198300723505/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 11888, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2619, "last_played": 1763179909, "avatar": "0b15d6fa7f0e3208fafd7637cdea2011ab6ae955"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "希望你们的挖矿技术比跳舞技术好！\n那该死的破铁罐儿去哪儿了？\n伙计们，下一杯我请！", "timestamp_created": 1539946079, "timestamp_updated": 1539946079, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 3, "weighted_vote_score": "0.554117381572723389", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "45324187", "author": {"steamid": "76561198372305668", "personaname": "B.S.L.", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198372305668/", "num_games_owned": 57, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 7199, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4393, "last_played": 1724580406, "avatar": "32dc64a2f6277608b859fc9731e0ac592052a9b9"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "首先说下优点：\n刚开始玩感觉老刺激了，一掉队找不到队友就慌得一批，常常要一个人面队大批的虫群，返回空降舱的时候也挺刺激，可惜只要有一个队友活着回去全队都有奖励，应该增加死亡队友的惩罚力度，比如只有5~10%的收益（顺带一提，侦查这个飞来飞去的优势在返回的时候得改改，不然都玩侦查，其它职业没人玩）。\n再说下缺点：\n1：虫子AI太低。\n因为虫子一股脑全跟着你跑，也没有去堵你路的智商，所以虫子其实很好杀，稍微多玩几把就会发现多挖硝石（弹药）找个稍微宽敞点的地型放风筝（边跑边打，只要别跑到死路里，如果有远程敌人，尽量多跑保证不被打的情况下优先干掉远程的，再慢慢清小鱼。）注意这两点就没啥难度了。所以会玩了就不觉得刺激了，像割草似的。\n2：最最最重要的是游戏内容实在太少\n升级速度太快，装备可升级内容太少（也没有新装备能买的）。太容易毕业了（特别是职业装备升级这块，随便玩几把就8级，8级就全部可以解锁了。消耗也不高，装备很快就满了，后面再升职业等级除了买时装也没啥意思了。），毕业之后就是反复的刷刷刷了，金币也完全没用了。\n创意还行，按这个画质来说78块贵了点（画风是一个原因，另外模型实在太粗糙）。", "timestamp_created": 1539869648, "timestamp_updated": 1539869648, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.559719860553741455", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "45322142", "author": {"steamid": "76561198413962612", "personaname": "猫头鹰", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198413962612/", "num_games_owned": 34, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 17337, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2462, "last_played": 1759098198, "avatar": "235b2677bef48e7b26692117df76774e6396bf8c"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "之前的笔记本cpu垃圾后缀带个u的，显卡也挖不动矿。不过没关系，花了1500欧元买了台新的笔记本（hp暗夜精灵），用了gtx1060 6g 挖矿效果杠杠滴", "timestamp_created": 1539858755, "timestamp_updated": 1546575893, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}]}